| **Basic/Interface** | `@VDM.viewType: #BASIC` | Direct table access, reusable |
| **Composite** | `@VDM.viewType: #COMPOSITE` | Joins basic views |
| **Consumption** | `@VDM.viewType: #CONSUMPTION` | For Fiori apps and reporting |

